Package: pdn-linmail
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Tom Fanning <tom@m0lte.uk>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.36)
Recommends: packetnet
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/M0LTE/linbpq
Description: LinBPQ mail BBS app package for the Packet.NET node (pdn)
 The LinBPQ mail server (G8BPQ's BPQMail) built on its own and connected to a
 Packet.NET node over RHPv2: personal mail, bulletins, FBB B1/B2 forwarding
 and webmail through the node's control panel. Ships as a Packet.NET app
 PACKAGE: pdn discovers it under /usr/share/packetnet/apps/linmail and the node
 owner enables it from the control panel. Inert without the packetnet node
 host (hence the soft Recommends), but installable standalone.
